{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40759323\",\n      \"design\": \"人类单病例研究（论文同时包含6-OHDA帕金森病大鼠实验；本条仅提取人类STN神经活动证据）\",\n      \"population\": \"一名60岁、伴有冻结步态（FOG）的帕金森病患者\",\n      \"n\": \"人类患者n=1\",\n      \"condition\": \"记录患者双侧丘脑底核（STN）电极的局部场电位（LFP），比较脊髓背柱刺激（DCS）导线植入前与植入后三天的神经活动。研究实施了基于皮质纹状体β振荡触发的DCS方案；摘要未明确报告患者的药物状态、具体步态测试范式及各次LFP记录时的DBS开启状态。研究还报告了DCS与DBS同时应用时的步态效果。\",\n      \"measure\": \"双侧STN局部场电位（LFP）、β频段振荡及相位-振幅耦合（PAC）；步态速度、步幅和冻结发作情况。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在人类单病例中，DCS干预后观察到步态速度增加、步幅增加、冻结发作减少，同时STN β振荡发生去同步化，并伴随PAC调节。DCS与DBS同时应用时，步态改善表现出组合效应。该研究报告了STN β振荡去同步化与FOG减少同时出现的现象，但没有提供STN β活动与FOG严重程度之间的定量相关分析。\",\n      \"effect\": \"方向性观察：DCS干预后STN β振荡去同步化与FOG发作减少并存，提示STN β活动可能参与与冻结步态相关的运动状态调节。但由于仅有一名人类患者，且缺乏定量相关分析和对照条件，不能据此确定β振荡变化与FOG改善之间的因果关系。\",\n      \"limitations\": \"论文提供的人类证据仅来自一名患者，样本量极小；观察时间仅涉及DCS导线植入前及植入后三天，缺乏长期随访；摘要未报告药物ON/OFF状态、具体步态任务、STN β振荡变化幅度及PAC变化的具体方向和数值；没有提供独立对照条件，也没有报告STN β活动与冻结发作之间的统计相关性。DCS同时可能影响多个神经环路，因此无法仅凭STN β振荡与步态改善同时发生，判断STN β活动变化是否为FOG改善的直接机制。动物实验使用皮质纹状体β振荡作为触发信号，而人类部分观察的是STN β振荡，两者的测量部位和证据性质不同，不应直接等同。\",\n      \"quote\": \"DCS increased gait velocity and stride length, reduced freezing episodes, and desynchronized subthalamic nucleus (STN) beta oscillations, while modulating phase-amplitude coupling (PAC).\",\n      \"basis\": \"abstract\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2c68e787-c89a-4ddf-b73e-212882e2a552", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T173845553850Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T17:39:12.788544+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d7535e42eef36277f123e9536fdd811e10a81ac96408475b560aa6147059878", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T173845553850Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7a661902c92c23c7900300043884caf71e2a7135e67d0d46133abd8271348d1a"}}}
